SUMMARY:IMPROMPTU LI - Doozie Doe Run (24 R)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRide Leader: Bruce Black\
 n\nAn enjoyable ride from Lititz exploring the Speedwell Forge area before
  heading to Manheim for some coffee at Today's Grind Coffee Shop. The pace
  will be 14 - 16 mph average with multiple regroup points (like 4 or 5). P
 lease park in the upper parking lot of the library.\n\nThis ride is a soci
 al ride\, but cyclists are not expected to stay in one group. Cyclists may
  pedal at their own comfortable paces. Please be supportive of the other c
 yclists to avoid anyone biking alone or being dropped off the back of the 
 last group.\n\nCue and Ride with GPS links:\n[LI - Doozie Doe Run (24 R)](
 https://ridewithgps.com/routes/56224732?privacy_code=cBf9IkchCWFxm74vB8Sa8
 UT5a1EVazkG)\n\nHelmets are mandatory\; please also plan to bring 1-2 wate
 r bottles\, and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 in
 flator).\nBeing a Meetup Member does not mean you are a club member. Use t
 his link to join the club.\n[https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.asp
 x?page_id=60&club_id=257148](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.asp
 x?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by the 
 club's Code of Conduct [https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?
 page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpre
 ss.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)\nand Rules
  of the Road\n[https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?](https:/
 /lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&modul
 e_id=325159)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3157614
 70/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260720T150833Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260720T150833Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
