SUMMARY:FUN Ride - NH That's a Nice Ride (18F)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n**Ride leader: volunteer 
 to lead**\n**Sweep: Volunteer to sweep!**\n**Anticipated Average Pace: 11 
 mph**\n\n**Route: [https://ridewithgps.com/routes/47750635](https://ridewi
 thgps.com/routes/47750635)**\n\n**This is a FUN RIDE. The ride leader will
  ride at the advertised average speed. This is intended to be a group ride
  with a no-drop rule as the main goal. The ride leader will do his/her bes
 t to keep the group together with occasional regroupings and a sweeper may
  also be appointed at the start.**\n**Please do not join this ride if you 
 are not willing to ride with the group.**\n\n**Helmets are mandatory. No e
 arbuds. Please bring water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire lever
 s\, pump/CO2 inflator).**\n\n**To eliminate passing around a pen and paper
  waiver\, we require LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join thi
 s ride. Being on Meetup does not mean you are a club member.**\n**Join her
 e** [Member Signup](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id
 =60&club_id=257148)\n**Your RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's 
 Code of Conduct:** [Code of Conduct](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/con
 tent.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\n**Guidance if an incident occurs:** 
 [Incident Actions](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&c
 lub_id=257148&module_id=326137)
