SUMMARY:Tour de France Watch Party with The Common Wheel
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nCome watch the Queen Stag
 e of the Tour de France! Coffee and donuts too.\n\nLBC is joining The Comm
 on Wheel to enjoy top level bike racing together. We will watch this penul
 timate stage live. Come relax and share bicycle racing on the world's bigg
 est stage with others.\n\nI will organize a ride to the Pump House\, proba
 bly from Landis Valley. Anyone up for a group ride afterwards?
